{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/280416-the-props-thread","id":280416,"title":"The Props Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-13T19:20:20-07:00","id":280416,"title":"The Props Thread","content":"hey guys, how ya been? are you looking for a Prop, a font, or something similar? you got a great idea to kickstart a game with an item to handle to your players? well, this is the place .<br /> <br /> Right now im going to start a Vtm campaing and im thinking on making Invitations for the players on a Camarilla Event, im looking for a good cursive font and to see if i can make the Camarilla symbol to seal these letters with wax.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T00:21:32-07:00","id":280663,"title":"","content":"Well most work processors have a cursive font standard. If you have Microsoft word, look up free hand script or French script. As for making the stamp for the wax, most craft stores sell stamp blanks ( its a small sheet of pink rubber, well at least it is here in the states.) they also should sell sticks of sealing wax ( don't use candle wax it won't stick to the paper).<br /> <br /> I once made a letter for introduction for a Venture character out of some paper I soaked in tea to make it look aged after writing a rather to the point introduction on it with the above font type. I then rolled the letter up and wrapped a black thread around it and then pressed the clan symbol on it with a stamp I made with the above blank.<br /> <br /> You are going to need an engraver kit to make the blank, but the auk is a fairly standard symbol so they might have one or just look for one online.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T13:22:11-07:00","id":281414,"title":"","content":"Something like this, but with a Camarilla seal?<br /> <img src=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/rpg/i/sabbat_opened_letter.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Check out the free font Aquiline Two for a formal, old-fashioned look:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.dafont.com/aquiline-two.font\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.dafont.com/img/dafont.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.dafont.com/aquiline-two.font\" target=\"_blank\"> Aquiline Two Font | dafont.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.dafont.com/aquiline-two.font\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.dafont.com/aquiline-two.font </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Aquiline Two Font | dafont.com </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You can order custom wax seals with any image you want (Camarilla symbol, Clan logos, personal signet of an elder, etc) on Etsy:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/listing/113817288/b20-design-your-own-gold-plated-wax-seal?ref=shop_home_active\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.etsystatic.com/7009013/r/il/4bdcad/3413735266/il_1080xN.3413735266_k39b.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/listing/113817288/b20-design-your-own-gold-plated-wax-seal?ref=shop_home_active\" target=\"_blank\"> Design Your Own Bespoke Custom Wax Seal Stamp Backtozero - Etsy </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/listing/113817288/b20-design-your-own-gold-plated-wax-seal?ref=shop_home_active\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.etsy.com/listing/113817288/b20-design-your-own-gold-plated-wax-seal?ref=shop_home_active </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This Wax Seals item by Backtozero has 6041 favorites from Etsy shoppers. Ships from Hong Kong. Listed on Mar 5, 2023 </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T15:47:01-07:00","id":282828,"title":"","content":"Here's a couple references on how traditional letter folding techniques, as were typically used with old-style seals.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.ghh.com/elf/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.ghh.com/elf/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found &ndash; GHH.COM </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.ghh.com/elf/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.ghh.com/elf/index.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://regencydelight-janeaustenetc.blogspot.com/2014/01/how-to-fold-regency-letter.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://regencydelight-janeaustenetc.blogspot.com/2014/01/how-to-fold-regency-letter.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://regencydelight-janeaustenetc.blogspot.com/2014/01/how-to-fold-regency-letter.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://regencydelight-janeaustenetc.blogspot.com/2014/01/how-to-fold-regency-letter.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T02:37:28-08:00","id":362243,"title":"","content":"Fantastic seals DC. Fantastic.<br /> <br /> For Props in my Werewolf Game I've made Necklaces and Bracelets with leather shoelaces and faux ivory and bone beads. I would paint glyphs on them and gave them out as Fetishes and Talens. I might have a few pictures of them somewhere. I think I have one small medicine bag I made for the game somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T09:54:18-08:00","id":362567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/280416-the-props-thread?p=362243#post362243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fantastic seals DC. Fantastic.<br /> <br /> For Props in my Werewolf Game I've made Necklaces and Bracelets with leather shoelaces and faux ivory and bone beads. I would paint glyphs on them and gave them out as Fetishes and Talens. I might have a few pictures of them somewhere. I think I have one small medicine bag I made for the game somewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>please, do upload pictures, would love to see it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T12:35:50-08:00","id":362812,"title":"","content":"I put together a number of prop books for my <b>Vampire: the Masquerade</b> chronicles. The one that I liked best is this book of transcriptions from the <i>Book of Nod</i> along with an accompanying letter:<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/GkxQNPO.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Inside it has some interesting fold outs and images:<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2A0HEyS.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I also made a smaller <i>Book of Nod</i>, a journal used by Lord Etrius of Clan Tremere, and a compiled book of the history of a particular old vampire who wanted to bring about the end of the world.<br /> <br /> ...I used to think that I'd made those things for the players in my troupe, but it turns out that I REALLY just made them for myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T16:51:08-08:00","id":365858,"title":"","content":"Anyone have tips on how to post photos from your mobile phone to the forums? I've got some pics of the props I found and whoo boy I even dug up a few I'd forgotten I had. But now getting the pictures posted is the tricky part for me. I use my phone the most since I'm at work when I'm checking the forums.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T12:10:35-08:00","id":366536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/280416-the-props-thread?p=365858#post365858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone have tips on how to post photos from your mobile phone to the forums?</div> </div> </div> </div>I put mine into an <b><a href=\"http://imgur.com/\" target=\"_blank\">imgur.com</a></b> account. I had thought that I could just link from the Google Drive, but that turns out to be a little more difficult than I'd hoped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T12:23:17-08:00","id":366538,"title":"","content":"Also, here's the cover of Lord Etrius' journal:<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/cAHYl7Q.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> ...And inside:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/717SRYq.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <b>Edit</b>: Wow! I didn't realise how BIG those images were! Hope it doesn't cause any problems...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T19:43:40-07:00","id":451197,"title":"","content":"hey guys, a friend of mine got a 3D printer and now me and my players are thinking on get some miniatures of our major and most beloved characters..the problem is we cant afford the Hero Forge so, any advices to 3D printing figures?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T09:20:54-07:00","id":451607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/280416-the-props-thread?p=451197#post451197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...any advices to 3D printing figures?</div> </div> </div> </div>I know that a lot of images of 3D scanned objects exist online, and they can be manipulated and scaled. My expertise as a librarian doesn't go so far as to really tell you HOW to do such manipulations, but I found a decent number of useable images online... Needless to say, mileage varies, and you might not agree with what counts as 'useable' for your purposes.<br /> <br /> Also (though I don't know your area), a number of public libraries around where I live have 3D printing capacity, and some of them have 3D scanners, too. It's the hardware that's really the expensive part, but the learning curve on the software is pretty steep, I hear. Still it's a possible avenue of inquiry.<br /> <br /> Yes, I cannot help being a librarian! I was just born that way, I guess? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}